OL,3,GNEWSAGuildhall Square turns red and
OL,4,Awhite for Derry City's FAI cup victory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victory marks a remarkable
OL,7,Fturnaround in the club's fortunes over
OL,8,Fthe course of what has been a
OL,9,Ftumultuous season both on and off the
OL,10,Ffield.
